WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.870 --> 00:00:02.810
Get ready for more Eddie.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:06.520
A post has sprung up on Reddit from a user
in Russia who claims to have seen a leaked

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:08.769
trailer for the upcoming Venom 2.

00:00:08.769 --> 00:00:12.719
While we haven't gotten a glimpse of it stateside
yet, the Redditor helpfully provided a full

00:00:12.719 --> 00:00:14.290
breakdown for us to chew on.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:18.680
While it seems like pretty much every 2020
film release has been pushed back to the fall

00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:23.270
in the wake of the ongoing COVID-19 outbreak,
it looks like Venom 2 will benefit from already

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.810
having been slated for release in that frame.

00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:30.830
The flick is due in theaters on October 2,
and so far, that release date has held firm.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:35.160
Fans of 2018's Venom were floored when, in
the flick's post-credits sequence, they were

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:39.440
introduced to a very dangerous inmate with
whom Eddie Brock had lined up an interview:

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:44.350
Cletus Kasady, a brutal serial killer who
is destined to become the insanely dangerous

00:00:44.350 --> 00:00:46.539
symbiotic villain Carnage.

00:00:46.539 --> 00:00:47.930
"Hi, Eddie."

00:00:47.930 --> 00:00:48.930
"Hey."

00:00:48.930 --> 00:00:55.300
"Do you mind if we forego the whole creepy
serial killer thing, here?"

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:59.579
According to our Russian Redditor, the trailer
for Venom 2 will give us our first, fleeting

00:00:59.579 --> 00:01:04.300
look at Kasady in full-on Carnage mode - while
also teasing the plot device which puts the

00:01:04.300 --> 00:01:07.860
murderer on a collision course with our favorite
tongue-y antihero.

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:11.860
Of course, we must state before we go any
further that this leak is in no way confirmed,

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:15.500
and it may just be the product of one Venom
fan's fertile imagination.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:19.290
Also, the events of the trailer - and its
dialogue - have been translated to English

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:23.500
from Russian with an online translator, so
we're basically just going to have to run

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.110
down the synopsis as best we can with the
information we have.

00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:31.030
Having said all that, the leak sounds pretty
legit - and it also sounds like Venom 2 is

00:01:31.030 --> 00:01:32.920
going to be pretty freakin' awesome.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:37.470
According to the Reddit post, the trailer
opens with a shot of San Francisco, as a voiceover

00:01:37.470 --> 00:01:40.070
lauds Venom as a new protector of the city.

00:01:40.070 --> 00:01:46.470
"You go anywhere in the city, preying on innocent
people, and we will find you and eat both

00:01:46.470 --> 00:01:49.770
of your arms and then both of your legs."

00:01:49.770 --> 00:01:53.720
We then see a group of children trick-or-treating,
but they've come to the wrong house: The door

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:58.570
is answered by Kasady, who removes his Halloween
mask to reveal that his face is starting to...well,

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.570
Carnage out.

00:01:59.570 --> 00:02:02.240
He then laughs, and the trailer cuts away.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:06.350
We then see Kasady pursuing Brock in a car
chase, with police on both their tails.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:10.439
Then, Brock is seen checking out a newspaper
clipping about an orphanage burning down.

00:02:10.439 --> 00:02:14.459
There's then a bit of conversation between
Brock and the Venom symbiote, with Brock indicating

00:02:14.459 --> 00:02:18.950
something to the effect that Carnage is just
getting started - again, the translation here

00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:19.950
isn’t great.

00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:23.560
Then, there's a scene of Brock transforming,
and Venom scaling the outside of a church

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:25.030
where Kasady is holed up.

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:29.260
The spot fades to black, and Carnage is heard
in voiceover saying that his goal is more

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.680
than just, well, wanton carnage.

00:02:31.680 --> 00:02:35.620
Before cutting to black, the trailer ends
with a brief scene of a cop shooting at Kasady,

00:02:35.620 --> 00:02:39.630
who stops the bullet with a gnarly tentacle
- and then, the cop screaming in terror as

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:45.500
Kasady begins to transform.

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:47.909
"Carnage…is…CHAOS!!"

00:02:47.909 --> 00:02:54.239
Again, even though the leak is far from confirmed
and the translation is rough, we're cautiously

00:02:54.239 --> 00:02:59.010
optimistic that our Russian Redditor did indeed
catch a sneak peek of the Venom 2 trailer.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:03.099
The description above a) follows all of the
typical beats of a standard superhero movie

00:03:03.099 --> 00:03:08.359
teaser trailer, and b) is pretty much exactly
what we would expect, teasing the confrontation

00:03:08.359 --> 00:03:12.279
between Venom and Carnage without giving away
too much of the movie's plot.

00:03:12.279 --> 00:03:15.769
Of course, we should know for certain whether
or not this leak is legit sooner rather than

00:03:15.769 --> 00:03:16.769
later.

00:03:16.769 --> 00:03:20.939
Like we mentioned, Venom 2 is still holding
fast to its October release date, and - assuming

00:03:20.939 --> 00:03:24.920
that there are no setbacks between now and
then - that only gives Sony about five months

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:26.080
to promote the flick.

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:30.209
Dropping a teaser trailer sooner rather than
later would be a pretty good way to get fans

00:03:30.209 --> 00:03:34.409
totally psyched for what might be one of their
first chances to catch a major movie in the

00:03:34.409 --> 00:03:36.219
theater post-COVID quarantine.

00:03:36.219 --> 00:03:41.779
And, since Venom cleared $850 million at the
worldwide box office, the sequel certainly

00:03:41.779 --> 00:03:43.489
qualifies as "major."

00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:47.030
You know us - we'll be keeping an eye out
for any official word on the leak, or better

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.749
yet, an actual trailer drop.

00:03:48.749 --> 00:03:52.669
As soon as we have either, we'll be beating
down your door with the news.

00:03:52.669 --> 00:04:01.059
"When I get out of here, and I will, there's
gonna be carnage."

